1
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,840
Thank you.

2
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,240
Dr. Xiao,

3
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,599
you've been working too hard
these past few days.

4
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:06,040
Director Zhang just announced that
the meeting is rescheduled for tomorrow.

5
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:06,840
You can finally take a break.

6
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,000
What's the date today?

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,640
August 8th.

8
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,000
What's wrong?

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,060
Still half asleep?

10
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,680
Xiao Han, is that you?

11
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:38,840
Where are you?

12
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,740
I'm at the rescue team office.

13
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:44,440
Just woke up on my desk.

14
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,020
Still wearing my uniform.

15
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,640
No stab wound on my chest.

16
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,460
What about the others?

17
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,440
I've contacted Pang, Qiqi,

18
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:56,000
and Xiaofei.

19
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,200
They all woke up safe.

20
00:01:58,479 --> 00:02:00,760
Xiao Han, we survived.

21
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:03,360
That damn system actually
let us come back.

22
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,720
Xiao Han, I'm at your hospital.

23
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,640
I've ordered noodles for you
at the BBQ stand on the back street.

24
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,570
Come over quick.

25
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,040
Coming.

26
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,720
I really can't believe it.

27
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,160
We actually survived

28
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,040
that hellish system.

29
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,240
I thought I was going to die
on that damn stage.

30
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,560
Here you go, freshly grilled lamb skewers.

31
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,560
It's all over now.

32
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,520
As long as everyone woke up in reality,
it's fine.

33
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:11,120
Boss, what's taking so long with the food?

34
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,640
Sorry, sorry.

35
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,680
Go rinse it with cold water.

36
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,600
It's fine, boss, go do your thing.
It doesn't hurt.

37
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,280
I'm really sorry.

38
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,640
Drinks are on the house tonight, brother.

39
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:23,900
I'll send over a couple more skewers
later to make up for it.

40
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,040
By the way,

41
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,040
I never gave you my number in the system.

42
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,100
How did you call me?

43
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:42,360
I'm with the city rescue team.

44
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,640
Getting a city hospital
forensic doctor's number

45
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,680
is a piece of cake.

46
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,810
Eat up, the noodles are getting soggy.

47
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,240
I'm going to the restroom.

48
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,280
Go ahead, come back quick.

49
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,740
The skewers will get cold.

50
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,690
Something's wrong.

51
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,200
Very wrong.

52
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,850
Your skills have improved.

53
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,640
Instead of eating your noodles,

54
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,920
you're practicing in this dark alley?

55
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,600
Just got a call
from the department director.

56
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,640
There's an emergency.

57
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,360
I have to get back to the hospital.

58
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,600
Alright, busy man.

59
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,730
Then hurry up and go.

60
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,440
Out of the city.

61
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,440
To the highway toll gate in the west.

62
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,560
City traffic is smooth today.

63
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,200
Planning route for you.

64
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,080
Planning failed.

65
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,240
Boundary not rendered.

66
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,880
Citizens, please stay in the safe zone.

67
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,840
Boundary not rendered.

68
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,340
We're here.

69
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,240
Dear citizen, target area

70
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,600
not rendered. Resetting space.

71
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,560
Reset complete.

72
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,200
Have a nice day.

73
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,340
Don't move.

74
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,840
The weather is really nice today.
